    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters TCG Fishing is a multiplayer game where the art of fishing meets exciting card battles. Catch monster cards, battle against opponents, and grow your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS EXPLORATION AND COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 300 unique monster cards. Catch these special creatures hidden inside oysters, expand your collection, and find the most valuable cards. Each monster card has its own unique powers like electricity, water, fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.mp4?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER AND EVOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment to catch rarer and more powerful monsters. Increase your hunting chances with special fishing rods, baits, and fishing poles. Each new equipment increases the chance of catching more valuable cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/890ce2e28f5b3bfeeb60dfa579d03378.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/890ce2e28f5b3bfeeb60dfa579d03378.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/890ce2e28f5b3bfeeb60dfa579d03378.mp4?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE YOUR OPPONENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your powerful deck and engage in intense battles with other players. Defeat your opponents in strategic card battles, gain experience, and take your place among the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/6f16f82fc175fe509a5ab8c58679fa40.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/6f16f82fc175fe509a5ab8c58679fa40.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/6f16f82fc175fe509a5ab8c58679fa40.mp4?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOCIALIZE AND CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other players, build friendships, and enjoy friendly competition. Customize your character with special outfits and accessories, create your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/39c13afc71c37ed93ef9ffb7b31ac8cd.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/39c13afc71c37ed93ef9ffb7b31ac8cd.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/39c13afc71c37ed93ef9ffb7b31ac8cd.mp4?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters TCG Fishing is a multiplayer game where the art of fishing meets exciting card battles. Catch monster cards, battle against opponents, and grow your collection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS EXPLORATION AND COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 300 unique monster cards. Catch these special creatures hidden inside oysters, expand your collection, and find the most valuable cards. Each monster card has its own unique powers like electricity, water, fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/75444f5727fe414c28ce33f7ceacdf1a.mp4?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER AND EVOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment to catch rarer and more powerful monsters. Increase your hunting chances with special fishing rods, baits, and fishing poles. Each new equipment increases the chance of catching more valuable cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/890ce2e28f5b3bfeeb60dfa579d03378.poster.avif?t=1752443167\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454620/extras/890ce2e28f5b3bfeeb60dfa579d03378.webm?t=1752443167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht